Jay Dyer debates Mark Brahmin on Christianity versus Apolloism and the problems of relativism. The discussion examines whether Apolloism provides a coherent metaphysical and ethical foundation, or if it ultimately reduces to subjective relativism and fails to ground truth, morality, and meaning in any objective way.


